{"translation":"ult","osis":"2John","name":"2 John","testament":"nt","title":"Second John","chapters":[{"n":1,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"The elder, to the chosen lady and her children, whom I love in truth—and not only I, but also all the ones having known the truth—","br":1,"sp":{"w":[[0,3,"G35880"],[4,9,"G42450"],[11,13,"G29590"],[14,17,"G29590"],[18,24,"G15880"],[25,29,"G29590"],[30,33,"G25320"],[34,37,"G08460"],[38,46,"G50430"],[48,52,"G37390"],[53,54,"G14730"],[55,59,"G00250"],[60,62,"G17220"],[63,68,"G02250"],[69,72,"G25320"],[73,76,"G37560"],[77,81,"G34410"],[82,83,"G14730"],[85,88,"G02350"],[89,93,"G25320"],[94,97,"G39560"],[98,101,"G35880"],[102,106,"G35880"],[107,113,"G10970"],[114,119,"G10970"],[120,123,"G35880"],[124,129,"G02250"]]}},{"n":2,"text":"because of the truth that remains in us and will be with us to eternity.","sp":{"w":[[0,7,"G12230"],[8,10,"G12230"],[11,14,"G35880"],[15,20,"G02250"],[21,25,"G35880"],[26,33,"G33060"],[34,36,"G17220"],[37,39,"G14730"],[40,43,"G25320"],[44,48,"G15100"],[49,51,"G15100"],[52,56,"G33260"],[57,59,"G14730"],[60,62,"G15190"],[63,71,"G01650"]]}},{"n":3,"text":"Grace, mercy, {and} peace will be with us from God the Father and from Jesus Christ, the Son of the Father, in truth and love.","sp":{"w":[[0,5,"G54850"],[7,12,"G16560"],[15,18,"G15150"],[20,25,"G15150"],[26,30,"G15100"],[31,33,"G15100"],[34,38,"G33260"],[39,41,"G14730"],[42,46,"G38440"],[47,50,"G23160"],[51,54,"G39620"],[55,61,"G39620"],[62,65,"G25320"],[66,70,"G38440"],[71,76,"G24240"],[77,83,"G55470"],[85,88,"G35880"],[89,92,"G52070"],[93,95,"G39620"],[96,99,"G39620"],[100,106,"G39620"],[108,110,"G17220"],[111,116,"G02250"],[117,120,"G25320"],[121,125,"G00260"]]}},{"n":4,"text":"I rejoiced greatly that I found some of your children walking in truth, just as we have received a commandment from the Father.","br":1,"sp":{"w":[[0,1,"G54630"],[2,10,"G54630"],[11,18,"G30290"],[19,23,"G37540"],[24,25,"G21470"],[26,31,"G21470"],[32,36,"G15370"],[37,39,"G15370"],[40,44,"G47710"],[45,53,"G50430"],[54,61,"G40430"],[62,64,"G17220"],[65,70,"G02250"],[72,76,"G25310"],[77,79,"G25310"],[80,82,"G29830"],[83,87,"G29830"],[88,96,"G29830"],[97,98,"G17850"],[99,110,"G17850"],[111,115,"G38440"],[116,119,"G35880"],[120,126,"G39620"]]}},{"n":5,"text":"And now I ask you, lady—not as writing a new commandment to you, but what we have had from the beginning—that we should love one another.","sp":{"w":[[0,3,"G25320"],[4,7,"G35680"],[8,9,"G20650"],[10,13,"G20650"],[14,17,"G47710"],[19,23,"G29590"],[24,27,"G37560"],[28,30,"G56130"],[31,38,"G11250"],[39,40,"G17850"],[41,44,"G25370"],[45,56,"G17850"],[57,59,"G47710"],[60,63,"G47710"],[65,68,"G02350"],[69,73,"G37390"],[74,76,"G21920"],[77,81,"G21920"],[82,85,"G21920"],[86,90,"G05750"],[91,94,"G07460"],[95,104,"G07460"],[105,109,"G24430"],[110,112,"G00250"],[113,119,"G00250"],[120,124,"G00250"],[125,128,"G02400"],[129,136,"G02400"]]}},{"n":6,"text":"And this is that love, that we should walk according to his commandments. This is the commandment, just as you heard from the beginning, that you should walk in it.","sp":{"w":[[0,3,"G25320"],[4,8,"G37780"],[9,11,"G15100"],[12,16,"G35880"],[17,21,"G00260"],[23,27,"G24430"],[28,30,"G40430"],[31,37,"G40430"],[38,42,"G40430"],[43,52,"G25960"],[53,55,"G25960"],[56,59,"G08460"],[60,72,"G17850"],[74,78,"G37780"],[79,81,"G15100"],[82,85,"G35880"],[86,97,"G17850"],[99,103,"G25310"],[104,106,"G25310"],[107,110,"G01910"],[111,116,"G01910"],[117,121,"G05750"],[122,125,"G07460"],[126,135,"G07460"],[137,141,"G24430"],[142,145,"G40430"],[146,152,"G40430"],[153,157,"G40430"],[158,160,"G17220"],[161,163,"G08460"]]}},{"n":7,"text":"For many deceivers have gone out into the world, the ones not confessing Jesus Christ coming in flesh. This is the deceiver and the antichrist.","sp":{"w":[[0,3,"G37540"],[4,8,"G41830"],[9,18,"G41080"],[19,23,"G18310"],[24,28,"G18310"],[29,32,"G18310"],[33,37,"G15190"],[38,41,"G35880"],[42,47,"G28890"],[49,52,"G35880"],[53,57,"G35880"],[58,61,"G33610"],[62,72,"G36700"],[73,78,"G24240"],[79,85,"G55470"],[86,92,"G20640"],[93,95,"G17220"],[96,101,"G45610"],[103,107,"G37780"],[108,110,"G15100"],[111,114,"G35880"],[115,123,"G41080"],[124,127,"G25320"],[128,131,"G35880"],[132,142,"G05000"]]}},{"n":8,"text":"Watch yourselves, that you do not lose what we have worked for, but may receive a full reward.","sp":{"w":[[0,5,"G09910"],[6,16,"G14380"],[18,22,"G24430"],[23,26,"G06220"],[27,29,"G06220"],[30,33,"G33610"],[34,38,"G06220"],[39,43,"G37390"],[44,46,"G20380"],[47,51,"G20380"],[52,58,"G20380"],[59,62,"G20380"],[64,67,"G02350"],[68,71,"G06180"],[72,79,"G06180"],[80,81,"G34080"],[82,86,"G41340"],[87,93,"G34080"]]}},{"n":9,"text":"Everyone going beyond and not remaining in the teaching of Christ does not have God. The one remaining in the teaching, this one has both the Father and the Son.","sp":{"w":[[0,8,"G35880"],[9,14,"G42540"],[15,21,"G42540"],[22,25,"G25320"],[26,29,"G33610"],[30,39,"G33060"],[40,42,"G17220"],[43,46,"G35880"],[47,55,"G13220"],[56,58,"G55470"],[59,65,"G55470"],[66,70,"G21920"],[71,74,"G37560"],[75,79,"G21920"],[80,83,"G23160"],[85,88,"G35880"],[89,92,"G35880"],[93,102,"G33060"],[103,105,"G17220"],[106,109,"G35880"],[110,118,"G13220"],[120,124,"G37780"],[125,128,"G37780"],[129,132,"G21920"],[133,137,"G25320"],[138,141,"G35880"],[142,148,"G39620"],[149,152,"G25320"],[153,156,"G35880"],[157,160,"G52070"]]}},{"n":10,"text":"If anyone comes to you and does not bring this teaching, do not receive him into your house and do not say to him, “Greetings.”","sp":{"w":[[0,2,"G14870"],[3,9,"G51000"],[10,15,"G20640"],[16,18,"G43140"],[19,22,"G47710"],[23,26,"G25320"],[27,31,"G53420"],[32,35,"G37560"],[36,41,"G53420"],[42,46,"G37780"],[47,55,"G13220"],[57,59,"G29830"],[60,63,"G33610"],[64,71,"G29830"],[72,75,"G08460"],[76,80,"G15190"],[81,85,"G36140"],[86,91,"G36140"],[92,95,"G25320"],[96,98,"G30040"],[99,102,"G33610"],[103,106,"G30040"],[107,109,"G08460"],[110,113,"G08460"],[116,125,"G54630"]]}},{"n":11,"text":"For the one saying to him, “Greetings,” shares in his evil deeds.","sp":{"w":[[0,3,"G10630"],[4,7,"G35880"],[8,11,"G35880"],[12,18,"G30040"],[19,21,"G08460"],[22,25,"G08460"],[28,37,"G54630"],[40,46,"G28410"],[47,49,"G20410"],[50,53,"G08460"],[54,58,"G41900"],[59,64,"G20410"]]}},{"n":12,"text":"Having much to write to you, I did not want with paper and ink. However, I hope to come to you and to speak mouth to mouth, so that your joy might be made complete.","br":1,"sp":{"w":[[0,6,"G21920"],[7,11,"G41830"],[12,14,"G11250"],[15,20,"G11250"],[21,23,"G47710"],[24,27,"G47710"],[29,30,"G10140"],[31,34,"G10140"],[35,38,"G37560"],[39,43,"G10140"],[44,48,"G12230"],[49,54,"G54890"],[55,58,"G25320"],[59,62,"G31890"],[64,71,"G02350"],[73,74,"G16790"],[75,79,"G16790"],[80,82,"G10960"],[83,87,"G10960"],[88,90,"G43140"],[91,94,"G47710"],[95,98,"G25320"],[99,101,"G29800"],[102,107,"G29800"],[108,113,"G47500"],[114,116,"G43140"],[117,122,"G47500"],[124,126,"G24430"],[127,131,"G24430"],[132,136,"G47710"],[137,140,"G54790"],[141,146,"G15100"],[147,149,"G15100"],[150,154,"G41370"],[155,163,"G41370"]]}},{"n":13,"text":"The children of your chosen sister greet you.","sp":{"w":[[0,3,"G35880"],[4,12,"G50430"],[13,15,"G00790"],[16,20,"G47710"],[21,27,"G15880"],[28,34,"G00790"],[35,40,"G07820"],[41,44,"G47710"]]}}]}]}
